{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Templar: Sacred Swing rank 2 becomes usable after avoiding an attack (#6069)",
  "contract": [
    "Rank-2 Sacred Swing 748501 reads 'Only usable after avoiding an attack.' Its Spell.dbc CasterAuraSpell is",
    "681170 Recently Parried or Dodged (8 s dummy aura); the client reads the same Spell.dbc (identical sha256)",
    "and greys the button until that aura is present, so a server-only aura-state requirement (PR #5918) never",
    "makes it usable. Sacred Swing requires Keeping the Oath 92109, whose effect 2 is",
    "SPELL_AURA_PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL for 681170 (AscensionDB/Exiles: 681170 'Procs from' Keeping the Oath). The",
    "Templar contract zeroed that effect. Expected: a dodged melee swing taken with Keeping the Oath grants",
    "681170, and Sacred Swing then hits and applies its slow 301061. QA Test 100% Dodge 10020 makes every swing a",
    "dodge; the attacker's hit rating removes misses. This checks the reported rank 2 at level 27 against current",
    "main, including refusal before avoidance and a successful slow after a native dodge."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
